docs/adr/0018-review-pull-request-handoff.md:7:The default idle trigger remains in place. If the Review Pull Request Handoff fails, Runtime State records a retryable pull request handoff failure and a later idle poll can retry. If the handoff succeeds, Symphony marks Batch Pull Request creation complete so later polls do not create duplicates.
spec/spec-process-protected-path-policy.md:18:This specification applies to Runtime Settings, task dispatch validation, changed-path inspection, Stage Commit, Stage Push, Task Branch Integration, Startup Reconciliation, Manual Task Merge, and Batch Pull Request handoff.
