spec/spec-process-protected-path-policy.md:67:### Runtime Settings Shape
spec/spec-process-protected-path-policy.md:69:The first version MUST use `git.protectedPaths` as the canonical Runtime Settings shape. The policy is omitted by default for backward compatibility. When present, `patterns` is an ordered list of named path patterns, and `authorizationSection` names the human-authored issue section Symphony reads before dispatch.
