spec/spec-architecture-agent-context-snapshot-runtime-semantics.md:26:- Installing or mutating global Codex lifecycle hooks.
spec/spec-architecture-agent-context-snapshot-runtime-semantics.md:34:- **Runtime Settings**: The `.symphony/settings.json` portion of the Runtime Contract.
spec/spec-architecture-agent-context-snapshot-runtime-semantics.md:35:- **Runtime State**: Ignored Runtime Home files and backend snapshots that record current orchestration activity.
spec/spec-architecture-agent-context-snapshot-runtime-semantics.md:37:- **Stage Goal Handoff**: A stage-specific Codex handoff that sets a Codex goal before the normal Agent Prompt.
spec/spec-architecture-agent-context-snapshot-runtime-semantics.md:38:- **Agent Context Snapshot**: A bounded, deterministic context section generated by the Symphony launch harness before agent launch or retry.
spec/spec-architecture-agent-context-snapshot-runtime-semantics.md:39:- **Context Command**: An optional operator-configured local command whose bounded stdout may supplement Agent Context Snapshot content.
spec/spec-architecture-agent-context-snapshot-runtime-semantics.md:43:- **REQ-001**: Agent Context Snapshot MUST be generated by the Symphony launch harness.
spec/spec-architecture-agent-context-snapshot-runtime-semantics.md:44:- **REQ-002**: Agent Context Snapshot MUST be scoped to the active Workspace Repository.
spec/spec-architecture-agent-context-snapshot-runtime-semantics.md:45:- **REQ-003**: Agent Context Snapshot MUST supplement, not replace, the Agent Prompt.
spec/spec-architecture-agent-context-snapshot-runtime-semantics.md:46:- **REQ-004**: Agent Context Snapshot MUST coexist with Stage Goal Handoff.
spec/spec-architecture-agent-context-snapshot-runtime-semantics.md:47:- **REQ-005**: Runtime Settings MUST own operator-configurable context behavior.
spec/spec-architecture-agent-context-snapshot-runtime-semantics.md:48:- **REQ-006**: Runtime State MAY expose context generation status and bounded diagnostics.
spec/spec-architecture-agent-context-snapshot-runtime-semantics.md:51:- **CON-001**: The implementation MUST NOT install or mutate global Codex lifecycle hooks.
spec/spec-architecture-agent-context-snapshot-runtime-semantics.md:54:- **GUD-001**: Use precise names such as Agent Context Snapshot and Context Command instead of ambiguous phrases such as "full context."
