+docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:70:### 1. Accept Agent Context Snapshot Runtime Semantics
+docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:74:Create the architectural decision and glossary updates for Symphony's bounded agent context model. The accepted model should define Agent Context Snapshot and Context Command as Workspace Repository scoped, harness-level behavior that supplements the Agent Prompt and Stage Goal Handoff without installing or mutating global Codex lifecycle hooks.
+docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:78:- [ ] Add an ADR under `docs/adr/` that states context generation happens in the Symphony launch harness, not through Codex lifecycle hooks.
+docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:80:- [ ] State that Agent Context Snapshot supplements the Agent Prompt and Stage Goal Handoff.
+docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:81:- [ ] State that Context Command stdout may supplement the Agent Prompt, while stderr and failures remain diagnostic by default.
+docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:82:- [ ] Update `CONTEXT.md` with accepted terms and avoid-list wording for ambiguous phrases such as "full context" or "context compression."
+docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:89:### 2. Inject A Built-In Agent Context Snapshot
+docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:93:Add a narrow, opt-in Agent Context Snapshot path for agent launches. When enabled for a matching Stage Agent, Symphony should append a deterministic bounded markdown snapshot to the composed Agent Prompt before launching the agent in its Agent Worktree.
+docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:106:- Slice 1: Accept Agent Context Snapshot Runtime Semantics.
+docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:108:### 3. Carry Retry Output Into The Agent Context Snapshot
+docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:112:Extend the built-in Agent Context Snapshot so retry launches include bounded context from the previous failed attempt. The retry context should help the next agent continue without storing or replaying the full transcript.
+docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:124:- Slice 2: Inject A Built-In Agent Context Snapshot.
